{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Did you just break up? Struggling with your studies? Is your boss a total jerk?<br>Forget it all and come smash a washing machine\u2014you\u2019ll feel so much better!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this unique game, you destroy various objects in a space arena against the clock.<br>Choose one of four different characters and show that damn washing machine who's boss!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Crushiator is a game developed solo by a designer with a rather... unusual mindset.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>4 unique characters</strong>: Each with distinct animations and smashing styles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>6 breakable objects</strong>: Washing machines, wooden crates, cars, and more!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Single-player mode</strong>: Try to beat your own record.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Local multiplayer (split-screen)</strong>: Face off against a friend! The first to break the object or deal the most damage wins.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Game Musics:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Menu music by qubesounds</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Arena music by Music by evgenybardyuzha </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3560530?t=1745248254","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560530/1a34198ee224fb047e1395ac0d4a1fb8c07bffa6/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745248254","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3560530/152e8d08af67520a